+    """Every compiled Wan VAE decode (the streaming step, Cosmos3's stateless
+    decode) is built without inductor's comprehensive stride padding, which
+    miscompiles the Wan2.2 decoder on torch 2.13 (GPU only, so this checks the
+    switch, not the numerics)."""
